{"id": "69690", "title": "随情所欲", "author": "桑玠", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 12, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/69/69690.htm", "intro": "冰冷而又唯利是图的香港豪门背景是血缘至亲帮他选择的无法逃脱的桎梏。\r\n他缺失的爱与温暖，却是高干家族里被父母宠爱的她从小拥有的。\r\n宿命不可逃，吸引而致命。\r\n一个人的爱究竟可以疯狂到什么地步？\r\n是疯狂到宁愿用自己一无所有来刺痛对方、成全对方的钟意如愿。\r\n\r\n你在这里\r\n你在我绝望、炙热、万劫不复的爱里\r\n————情路系列第三部《随情所欲》站里原来的没更完\r\n\r\n内容标签：高干 情有独钟 都市情缘", "base": "files/article/html/69/69690", "chapters": [{"title": "1-5", "file": "10677242.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "10677243.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-15", "file": "10677244.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-20", "file": "10677245.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-25", "file": "10677246.html", "available": false}, {"title": "26-30", "file": "10677247.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-35", "file": "10677248.html", "available": false}, {"title": "36-40", "file": "10677249.html", "available": false}, {"title": "41-45", "file": "10677250.html", "available": false}, {"title": "46-50", "file": "10677251.html", "available": false}, {"title": "51完结+番外", "file": "10677252.html", "available": false}, {"title": "番外", "file": "10677253.html", "available": false}]}